### TASK 1 — GET order (happy path)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/2
Accept: application/json

###

### TASK 1 — GET order not found (404)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/orders/999
Accept: application/json

###

### TASK 2 — Fulfill order (happy path)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/orders/2/fulfill
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statusName": "Completed"
}

###

### TASK 2 — Order not found (404)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/orders/999/fulfill
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statusName": "Completed"
}

###

### TASK 2 — Status not found (404)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/orders/1/fulfill
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statusName": "DoesNotExist"
}

###

### TASK 2 — Already completed (409)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/orders/2/fulfill
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "statusName": "Completed"
}

###

### TASK 2 — Missing body / bad request (400)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/orders/1/fulfill
Content-Type: application/json

{}
